    "profile_id": "profile_rakdos_gate3_authoritative_overview",
    "overview": "Cult of Rakdos is the black-red Ravnican guild expressed through performance, spectacle, anti-authoritarian provocation, and dangerous entertainment.",
    "philosophy": "Rakdos treats performance as public release: appetite, provocation, and visible cost expose what polite restraint hides.",
    "core_tension": "Rakdos is strongest when spectacle and sensation have an audience or consequence; it weakens when reduced to generic black-red aggression, random disruption, or harm without an act.",
    "social_or_institutional_role": "The official guide presents Rakdos as loosely organized around performances, Rings, clubs, festivals, travelling troupes, and the demon Rakdos himself.",
    "mechanics_and_play_pattern": "Spectacle rewards action after an opponent has lost life, expressing Rakdos's source-bounded taste for consequence, audience, and escalation.",
